\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Q4 也比 nf4 慢一点，但质量要好得多</p><p>速度 Q4 与 Q8</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/88af6a53-67c2-45d2-a63f-d9e8839d7466/width=525/88af6a53-67c2-45d2-a63f-d9e8839d7466.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>v2_FLUX_D_model_Q8_clip_Q8</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/7a067460-4b61-46a4-98b0-5c995edc6365/width=525/7a067460-4b61-46a4-98b0-5c995edc6365.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>v2_FLUX_D_model_Q8_clip_Q8_IMG_TO_MG</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/baa3a97e-b5a4-4fc3-b55d-aed3f9bb4b09/width=525/baa3a97e-b5a4-4fc3-b55d-aed3f9bb4b09.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>v2_FLUX_D_model_Q8_clip_Q8_LORA.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/9e67f7e6-4208-41e9-b2ab-adc688a91505/width=525/9e67f7e6-4208-41e9-b2ab-adc688a91505.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>v2_FLUX_D_model_Q8_clip_Q8_LORA_IMG_TO_MG</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/f902ba70-0197-4748-9551-8c6059d1ba9b/width=525/f902ba70-0197-4748-9551-8c6059d1ba9b.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Comparison T5xx fp16 to Q8 - almost the same quality</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/cae380f5-ecfa-4157-b485-371419f52eba/width=525/cae380f5-ecfa-4157-b485-371419f52eba.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/92ea4a11-4a51-456e-bea2-92a3748fe145/width=525/92ea4a11-4a51-456e-bea2-92a3748fe145.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Comparison Q4 to Q8 (Q8 is extremely close fp16) - Q4 slightly dropped quality but still much better than nf4.</p><p>Q4</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/32e7a6bb-0dae-4370-916d-3355ee0c5e57/width=525/32e7a6bb-0dae-4370-916d-3355ee0c5e57.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\">Q8</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/58a02493-ae95-407b-b83b-d11825ea2f5f/width=525/58a02493-ae95-407b-b83b-d11825ea2f5f.jpeg\" loa